{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Mercury Retrograde"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "You Need a Time-Out"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le17ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">That</span>-Clauses: Review"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Noun clauses are groups of words in a sentence referring to a fact. They can sometimes be replaced by a noun or pronoun."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the pronoun <span class=\"italic\">that </span>to refer to these clauses. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I know <span class=\"strong\">that you didn't mean to do it</span>.</span> <br/> You use noun clauses after some nouns and after some adjectives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "That-clauses can be the <span class=\"underline\">subject </span>of the sentence. You normally use this structure in formal writing or speaking. <br/> For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">That we don't care</span> is simply not true.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use a that-clause as the <span class=\"underline\">object </span>(after reporting verbs), you often omit <span class=\"italic\">that</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">She promised (that) she would come.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you report statements, you can use a that-clauses in the reported clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">She <span class=\"strong\">said that</span> she was enjoying the show.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can omit <span class=\"italic\">that </span>after the most common report verbs, such as: <span class=\"italic\">agree, mention, notice, promise, say </span>and <span class=\"italic\">think</span>. However, you do not remove it if the clause does not come right after the verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">He <span class=\"strong\">agreed </span>with everyone <span class=\"strong\">that </span>it would be better to wait.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's good that you are a Taurus."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think that she really helped me to focus on what I wanted to do and organize myself for my job search."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The resume that I used then was written by her."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I recall that the relationship that we had was good but it could also be volatile. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think that that was what eventually broke us up."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Narrative Tenses: Review"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use narrative tenses when you want to tell a story. They connect different past events in different ways. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Look at the chart for a summary of narrative tense and how to use them:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" For completed actions in the past which tell the main event in a story. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It <span class=\\\"strong\\\">wasn't </span>perfect but we <span class=\\\"strong\\\">got </span>along very well.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To set the general scene of a story <br/>To talk about actions in progress at or around a particular point in a story,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She was also ambitious and <span class=\\\"strong\\\">was pushing </span>me to be as well. <br/> We <span class=\\\"strong\\\">were living </span>together and we ended up getting in a huge fight over her expensive taste.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Talk about actions or situations that were completed before another action in the story.  <br/> The past perfect makes the order clear.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had </span>just <span class=\\\"strong\\\">finished </span>school when we met.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Perfect Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To talk about longer actions or situations which started before and continued up to a point in the story.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had been looking </span>for work and she was very supportive.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "common sense"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bability to use good \u200bjudgment in making \u200bdecisions "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They have a lot of common sense."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to recall"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to \u200bbring the \u200bmemory of a past \u200bevent"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I recall that the relationship that we had was good but it could also be volatile."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "purchase"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "item obtained with an exchange of money "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  She was also quite materialistic and made a lot of expensive purchases."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "at my wit's end"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "perplexed; frustrated at not being able to solve a problem"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sometimes I was at my wit's end because of all the money she spent. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "courteous"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "polite; respectful"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We're not friends but we are courteous to each other. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to end up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "finally be in a particular place or situation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We were living together and we ended up getting in a huge fight over her expensive taste. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "On the internet, research your Chinese astrological sign (an animal sign based on your birth year)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare what you know about your star sign to what you learn about your Chinese astrological sign."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph comparing the two signs and explaining which you think is a more accurate description of you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your class or group."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research my Chinese astrological sign."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compare my Chinese astrological sign with my star sign."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph about my comparison."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my paragraph to a group."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob11re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le17ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So, Peter. I'm curious now. What can you tell me about my sign? My birthday is May 9.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  It's good - you are a Taurus.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Why?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Tauruses seem to get along with everyone. They are generous, dependable, and down-to-earth. They have a lot of common sense. They are also independent and persistent so employers tend to like them.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le17ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"></span>I used to date a Taurus. Of course, it wasn't perfect but we got along very well. I had just finished school when we met. I had been looking for work and she was very supportive. She was also ambitious and was pushing me to be as well. I think that she really helped me focus on what I wanted to do and organize myself for my job search. The resume that I used then was written by her. In fact, I have used it ever since.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She must have been really great for you.", "id": 2, "time": "26000", "image": "engenn10le17ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, I recall that the relationship that we had was good but it could also be volatile. Tauruses have tempers. They can handle stress but when they are pushed to far they can get very angry. That she could quickly lose her temper was a problem for us. She was also quite materialistic and made a lot of expensive purchases. Sometimes I was at my wit's end because of all the money she spent.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : That couldn't have been easy for you. I know how frugal you are.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span> : Yeah. I think that that was what eventually broke us up. We were living together and we ended up getting in a huge fight over her expensive taste. We're not friends but we are courteous to each other. My next girlfriend was a Pisces. A much better match!", "id": 3, "time": "56500", "image": "engenn10le17ob11re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express opinions and beliefs."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can say what happened and what was happening, what had happened, and what had been happening."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can speculate about the past with different degrees of certainty."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Which type of person are you most and least compatible with?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you believe that astrology can tell you which people are good matches for you? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Let's review!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nPeter explains why Aquarius and Taurus aren't a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">good love match</span>.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.\n"}]}, {"type": "tips", "content": [{"tip_id": 0, "type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> \u201cA good love match\u201d </span>is when two people work well together in a love relationship."}]}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "con